The condition in `buildInviteLink` was flipped from `!isOrgContext` to `isOrgContext`:

::diff{file="packages/features/ee/teams/services/teamService.ts" lines="104-112"}

Now organizations and org sub-teams get `/teams?token=…`, and regular teams get `/signup?token=…&callbackUrl=/getting-started`. That's the opposite of what the PR description says (org context should route through `/signup`) and of the original behavior. This is shared code, so the web UI's "copy invite link" flow (tRPC `createInvite`) also gets the wrong links for every team type.

